## Lab 1 Carat Asscher Cut Diamond Ring Prices

In lab asscher cuts, the clarity premium works differently. Because lab D-IF stones are available at a fraction of natural equivalent prices, many buyers skip straight to the top grades. The [IGI 1.52ct D-IF lab asscher at $2,795](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/27991043?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) is the benchmark entry — you get 52% more carat size than a 1ct natural for a similar or lower price.

Why D-IF in a lab asscher? Because The Clarity Floor is even more important at larger sizes. At 1.5ct, VS1 in a step cut can still be borderline — D-IF eliminates the question entirely.

In lab diamonds, D-IF costs $2,795 — versus $30,000+ for a natural equivalent. You buy the grade that removes all doubt.

