## Expert Summary

The 1 carat asscher cut diamond ring has a specific set of requirements that separate it from every other ring category. The Clarity Floor is VS1. The Color Floor is G.

The Total Ring Number starts at $3,324 and reaches $3,985 with an Art Deco setting. Every number in this post is real, certified market data from current inventory.

The 3 mistakes in the title are real traps that cost buyers money. Buying VS2 risks an included-looking stone because the step facets mirror every internal feature.

Skipping the setting budget creates a surprise at checkout. Going below G color creates a warm-looking stone that the step facets will expose in white metal.

The asscher cut is one of the most distinctive shapes in fine jewelry. It is the ring that says you chose this shape specifically because you love its geometry and its history — not because it sparkles more than a round. These numbers give you the complete picture to make that purchase correctly.

Full asscher cut buying resources at the [asscher cut diamond guide](/asscher-cut-diamond).

